on]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SharpCodeForReal}_S(y,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SharpCodeForReal}_S(y,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both aliases reuse the upstream theory-code presentation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\#\">\\(x^\\#\\)</span>; the former version invoked an undeclared premouse-over-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> predicate and therefore did not actually formalize its minimal-premouse characterization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real.md","status":"resolved","id":"62983ac7606858a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnc